      "text": "Sub: Filling up the post of Joint Director earmarked for Indian Police Service (IPS)\n officers under Non-Central Staffing Scheme of the MoEF&CC in Wildlife Crime\n Control Bureau HQ, New Delhi in WCCB-reg.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 4,
      "poly": [
        86.87,
