        232.39,
        86.87,
        232.39
      ],
      "text": "Sir/Madam,",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        86.87,
        248.39,
        521.22,
        248.39,
        521.22,
        283.75,
        86.87,
        283.75
      ],
      "text": "I am directed to refer to the subject cited above and to say that Ministry of\nEnvironment, Forest & Climate Change intends to fill up the below mentioned one\npost, on deputation basis:-",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        86.27,
        297.23,
        520.62,
        297.23,
        520.62,
        352.8,
        86.27,
        352.8
      ],
      "text": null,
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><td>Name of the post</td><td>Station</td><td>Equivalent to the post</td><td>Service for which earmarked</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Joint Director, Level 13A in Pay Matrix of 7th CPC</td><td>New Delhi</td><td>Deputy Inspector General of Police</td><td>Indian Police Service</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        86.27,
        367.11,
        520.62,
        367.11,
        520.62,
        428.58,
        86.27,
        428.58
      ],
      "text": "2. It is, therefore, requested that aforesaid post may be given wider publicity and\nnames of willing IPS officers of the rank of DIG may be forwarded to this Ministry at\nthe earliest. While sending the nominations, it may please be ensured that the officers\nare clear from vigilance angle. The names should be reached this Ministry within a\nperiod of one month after issuance of this letter.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
